# Force non-www canonical. Fixes Google Search Console "Duplicate without
# user-selected canonical" indexing issue identified June 10, 2026.
# Any request to www.gebauerwatches.com 301s to the non-www canonical.
https://www.gebauerwatches.com/* https://gebauerwatches.com/:splat 301!
http://www.gebauerwatches.com/*  https://gebauerwatches.com/:splat 301!
http://gebauerwatches.com/*      https://gebauerwatches.com/:splat 301!

# /blog retired Aug 1 2026. The route was removed from main.jsx, so without
# these rules the SPA would render the homepage at /blog, which is a soft 404
# and Google treats those as a quality problem. A 301 tells crawlers the pages
# are gone and moves any existing link equity to the homepage.
# Substack is the publication. See gebauer-site/src/posts.js for the archive.
/blog/*  /  301
/blog    /  301

# /specs retired Aug 17 2026. The specification table now lives inline under
# the watches on the homepage - one page instead of sending people to a second
# one. The URL is kept alive because it is in llms.txt and was mailed out.
/specs   /#watches   301
/specs/  /#watches   301

# SPA routes, added Nov 18 2026 with /story.
#
# These are rewrites, not redirects: the URL stays put and Cloudflare serves
# the freshly built index.html, so React boots and main.jsx picks the route off
# window.location.pathname.
#
# Without them Cloudflare falls through to public/404.html, which is a stale
# hand-copied shell hardcoding /assets/index-BUdVLOXM.js. Vite content-hashes
# that filename on every build, so the reference died the next time anyone ran
# one. Verified Nov 18 2026: gebauerwatches.com/privacy returned 404 and
# pointed at that missing bundle, meaning the privacy policy linked in the
# footer rendered a blank page. These rules fix that for all three routes.
#
# Deliberately NOT a /* catch-all. A catch-all would answer genuinely missing
# URLs with 200 and the homepage, which is the soft-404 problem the /blog rules
# above exist to avoid. New SPA routes get a line here.
/story     /index.html  200
/story/*   /index.html  200
/privacy   /index.html  200
/privacy/* /index.html  200
/vote      /index.html  200
/vote/*    /index.html  200
